  "mitigations": [
    "each view webview is built with incognito(true), so every view has its own storage",
    "hostile.html is served with the CSP directive sandbox allow-scripts",
    "the view webview loads a script-less wrapper page from the view server that frames hostile.html, served with the CSP default-src 'none'; frame-src 'self', the containment the main window frame-src gives in frame mode",
    "each view is a child webview of the main window, without a window of its own and without a capability, behind the navigation, new-window and download guards of the view windows"
  ],
